{
  "company_name": "WellFlow Monitoring",
  "industry": "Oil & Gas Upstream",
  "use_case": "Well production monitoring and flow optimization",
  "space_title": "WellFlow Monitoring - Well Production Monitoring \ud83d\udcca",
  "space_description": "**Subindustry:** Oil & Gas Upstream\n\n**Use case:** Well Production Monitoring & Flow Optimization\n\nWellFlow Monitoring \u2014 daily well surveillance across 20 horizontal and vertical wells on 11 multi-well pads (Wolfcamp, Bone Spring, Spraberry, Eagle Ford, Niobrara, Bakken, Haynesville, Marcellus, Utica, Woodford, SCOOP, San Andres). Production Engineers use this space to triage low-rate and shut-in wells day-to-day; the Asset Manager and Field Superintendent use it to rank deferred-production opportunities, monitor lift efficiency, and benchmark pad-level LOE/BOE for monthly performance reviews.\n\n**Key KPIs**\n- Oil rate (BOPD), gas rate (MCF/day), water rate (BPD) \u2014 primary production volumes\n- Well uptime % \u2014 target \u226595%; <90% triggers root-cause review\n- Artificial lift efficiency % \u2014 ESP/rod pump fitness; <70% flags optimization\n- Water cut % \u2014 >60% prioritizes water-handling capacity, >75% near economic limit\n- GOR (SCF/BBL) \u2014 gas-oil ratio; rising GOR can indicate gas breakthrough\n- Tubing & casing pressure (PSI) \u2014 flow assurance indicators\n- Deferred oil (BBL) \u2014 production loss from downtime / chokes / shut-ins\n- LOE per BOE (USD) \u2014 lease operating expense; onshore US benchmark $6-12/BOE\n\n**Data sources**\n- `production_readings` \u2014 daily oil/gas/water rates, tubing & casing pressure, well status per well\n- `well_status_snapshots` \u2014 weekly cumulative oil, water cut, GOR, uptime, lift efficiency per well\n- `production_kpi_monthly` \u2014 monthly oil/gas volumes, deferred oil BBL, LOE/BOE per well and pad",
  "schema_basename": "og_upstream_wellflow",
  "tables": [
    {
      "table_name": "production_readings",
      "description": "Daily well production readings.",
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "reading_id",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Reading ID",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "CONCAT('WR-', LPAD(CAST(ROW_NUMBER() OVER (ORDER BY d.dt, e.well_id) + 100000 AS STRING), 8, '0'))"
        },
        {
          "name": "reading_date",
          "sql_type": "DATE",
          "comment": "Reading date",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "d.dt"
        },
        {
          "name": "well_id",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Well ID",
          "is_dimension": true,
          "generation_expr": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "well_name",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Well name",
          "is_dimension": true,
          "generation_expr": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "well_type",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Type: Horizontal, Vertical",
          "is_dimension": true,
          "generation_expr": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "pad_name",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Pad name",
          "is_dimension": true,
          "generation_expr": ""
        },
        {
          "name": "oil_bpd",
          "sql_type": "DOUBLE",
          "comment": "Oil BPD",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "ROUND(GREATEST(5.0, 100.0 + ({qty_noise} * {seasonal_mult}) * 2900.0), 0)",
          "seasonal_amplitude": 0.15
        },
        {
          "name": "gas_mcfpd",
          "sql_type": "DOUBLE",
          "comment": "Gas MCF/day",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "ROUND(GREATEST(20.0, 300.0 + ({qty_noise} * {seasonal_mult}) * 9700.0), 0)",
          "seasonal_amplitude": 0.15
        },
        {
          "name": "water_bpd",
          "sql_type": "DOUBLE",
          "comment": "Water BPD",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "ROUND(GREATEST(5.0, 30.0 + ({qty_noise} * {seasonal_mult}) * 1500.0), 0)",
          "seasonal_amplitude": 0.15
        },
        {
          "name": "tubing_pressure_psi",
          "sql_type": "DOUBLE",
          "comment": "Tubing pressure PSI",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "ROUND(GREATEST(50.0, 200.0 + {qty_noise} * 1800.0), 0)"
        },
        {
          "name": "casing_pressure_psi",
          "sql_type": "DOUBLE",
          "comment": "Casing pressure PSI",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "ROUND(GREATEST(50.0, 150.0 + {qty_noise} * 1350.0), 0)"
        },
        {
          "name": "well_status",
          "sql_type": "STRING",
          "comment": "Status: Flowing, Shut-In, Workover, Completion, Abandoned",
          "is_dimension": false,
          "generation_expr": "CASE WHEN {status_noise} < 0.72 THEN 'Flowing' WHEN {status_noise} < 0.82 THEN 'Shut-In' WHEN {status_noise} < 0.90 THEN 'Workover' WHEN {status_noise} < 0.96 THEN 'Completion' ELSE 'Abandoned' END"
        }
      ],
      "seasonal_patterns": {
